{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section called "Featured Collection (2×2 Grid)" in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, editorial, timeless, elegant, and clean.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display a curated selection of products from a chosen collection in a compact editorial grid.
    
    The section should feel like a luxury fashion ecommerce collection and be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    FUNCTIONALITY
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Display 4 products from a selected collection by default.
    
    Products should automatically update when the selected collection changes.
    
    Include a product count selector:
    
    • Default: 4
    • Minimum: 2
    • Maximum: 8
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    LAYOUT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Desktop:
    
    • 2 columns × 2 rows.
    • Center the entire grid.
    • Grid container max-width: 780px.
    • Gap between columns: 16px.
    • Gap between rows: 24px.
    • Side padding: 40px.
    
    Mobile:
    
    • 2 columns.
    • Gap between columns: 8px.
    • Gap between rows: 16px.
    • Side padding: 16px.
    
    The grid should remain compact and centered.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    PRODUCT CARD
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Display:
    
    • Product image
    • Product title
    • Product price
    
    Style:
    
    • No borders.
    • No shadows.
    • No rounded corners.
    • border-radius: 0 !important;
    • Left-aligned typography.
    • Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font).
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    PRODUCT IMAGE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Every product card must use an identical image container.
    
    Requirements:
    
    • Fixed aspect ratio: 4:5.
    • Every image container must have exactly the same width and height.
    • The image container size must NEVER change depending on the product image.
    • All cards must remain perfectly aligned.
    
    Inside the container:
    
    • object-fit: contain;
    • object-position: center;
    • width: 100%;
    • height: 100%;
    
    Never crop the product image.
    
    Never stretch or distort the image.
    
    Always preserve the original proportions.
    
    Apply identical internal padding to every image container:
    
    • Desktop: 14px.
    • Mobile: 8px.
    
    The internal padding must be identical for every product.
    
    The image itself should never determine the size of the card.
    
    The visible size of every product image should remain visually consistent across the grid, regardless of the original image framing.
    
    Background:
    
    • White or transparent.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    PRODUCT INFORMATION
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Place the title and price directly below the image.
    
    Maintain compact spacing.
    
    Typography:
    
    • Times New Roman.
    • Serif.
    • Regular weight.
    • Left aligned.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION HEADING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Optional centered heading.
    
    Settings:
    
    • Heading text.
    • Show / Hide heading.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include:
    
    • Collection picker.
    • Product count.
    • Heading text.
    • Show / Hide heading.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    STYLE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Luxury fashion editorial.
    
    Minimal.
    
    Clean.
    
    Timeless.
    
    Keep the current compact layout and spacing.
    
    Do not allow different product photos to create cards of different visual sizes.
    
    All image containers and product cards must always appear perfectly uniform.
    
    Fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Scope all CSS only to this section.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = section.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 40px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px 16px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: #000000;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    color: #000000;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px 8px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if section.settings.show_heading and section.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ section.settings.heading }}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if section.settings.collection != blank %}
        {% assign product_limit = section.settings.product_count %}
        {% for product in section.settings.collection.products limit: product_limit %}
          <a
            href="{{ product.url }}"
            class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="600"
                  height="750"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ product.title }}
              </h3>
              <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ product.price | money }}
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          <div class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-collection-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Product title
              </h3>
              <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                R$ 0,00
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured collection grid",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "product_count",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Products to show",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_heading",
      "label": "Show heading",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading text",
      "default": "Featured collection"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured collection grid"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
